  "seoBody": "<h2>£75 a month for each phone number</h2><p>Everyone else can read the reports, use the dashboard, share and download for free. Billed monthly by UK Direct Debit.</p><h2>14-day free trial</h2><p>Everything is unlocked. You need no card to start. You add a Direct Debit when the trial ends.</p><p>Paid accounts have no limits on reports, photos or messages.</p><h2>Why not per seat?</h2><p>Most tools charge for every name on the account, used or not. Quickler charges for each phone number on the account. Read <a href=\"/pages/no-subscription-compliance.html\">why we charge this way</a>.</p><h2>Bigger teams</h2><p>Have a big team? <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">Talk to us</a>. Quickler works in any country WhatsApp does. See <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">Quickler worldwide</a>.</p><h2>Pricing questions</h2><h3>How much does Quickler cost?</h3><p>£75 a month for each phone number on the account. Everyone else can read the reports, use the dashboard, share and download for free.</p><h3>Which phone numbers do I pay for?</h3><p>Each phone number on the account. People who only read reports, use the dashboard, share or download pay nothing.</p><h3>Is there a free trial?</h3><p>Yes. You get 14 days free with everything unlocked. You need no card to start.</p><h3>Do I pay per seat?</h3><p>No. Most tools charge for every name on the account. Quickler charges for each phone number on the account.</p><h3>How is Quickler billed?</h3><p>Monthly, by UK Direct Debit. You add one when the free trial ends.</p>",
